cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: "If you use this software or the bundled dataset, please cite the work below."
title: "arista: calcium-imaging corpus and analysis package for Drosophila arista thermosensory neurons"
abstract: >
  Python package that ingests preprocessed calcium-imaging recordings of the
  six thermosensory neurons in the Drosophila melanogaster arista
  (three hot cells, three cold cells) into a single SQLite database and
  rebuilds the publication figures supporting the role of NompC in
  thermosensation. Ships a headless preprocessing CLI (arista-preprocess)
  that reproduces the original pytci pipeline on user-supplied Fiji
  delta F over F exports and MATLAB sensor MAT files.
type: software
